      "typical_award_size": "FY 2026-27: CDBG $1,361,629 plus $173,385 carried over; HOME $403,480 ($399,969.98 per the CAPER) plus $612,500 carried from the first HOME year ($403,479.96 federal HOME, $96,520.04 state HOME to reach the $500,000 entitlement threshold, $112,500 County match). The Urban County (first designated 2013, more than $17 million of CDBG since) covers the unincorporated area, Gonzales, Greenfield, Marina and Sand City; three-year CDBG total estimated at $4,015,543 for 2025-2027. HOME, first received in 2025, is restricted to unincorporated areas and may fund new construction, acquisition, rehabilitation or rental assistance.",
